  "shared_index_entries": [
    {
      "path": "RESEARCH.md",
      "paragraph": "**Regenerative direction and direct material renewal, 7 October 2026:** [The integrated continuation](_process/research/2026-10-05-generative-foundation-review/root-foundation/REGENERATIVE-DIRECTION-INTEGRATION.md) defends actually formed regenerative capacity as a positive contribution under Ren’s criterion, with a rival that accepts abiotic achievement but disputes the significance of unused productive capacity. A direct Lean proof shows actual inquiry and recovery regenerate a backed formation input, retaining finite source and all eight supported stages; initial formation requires nine. A separate checked distinction prevents complete-law reachability from being mistaken for already formed organization. Fresh verification passes 27 modules/647 audits, with 21 new declarations and explicit standard dependencies. **Next ethical inference:** justify the favorable character and practical significance of actual unexercised productive capacity against terminal achievement and whole losses. Neither another organization nor universal ethical warrant is proved.",
      "paragraph_sha256": "ce5c80d06a16103a54a76642c9448d38f4c5ec45fe1f651cea1bbf48d02db27c"
    },
    {
      "path": "theories/shengsheng-buxi-generative-existence/README.md",
      "paragraph": "**Regenerative direction and direct material renewal, 7 October 2026:** [The new integration](../../_process/research/2026-10-05-generative-foundation-review/root-foundation/REGENERATIVE-DIRECTION-INTEGRATION.md) combines a positive ethical argument about actual regenerative capacity, substantive counterreview and source assessment with a direct proof in the existing port. Inquiry and recovery regenerate a backed formation input while consuming finite source; a distinct actual formation is not inferred from accumulated spares. Lean 4.29.1 checks 21 new declarations in a fresh 27-module closure. The reachability/formed-condition clarification preserves the old renewal theorem. Universal warrant remains open; the next connection concerns the favorable significance of usable but unexercised capacity and its practical relation to finite achievement.",
      "paragraph_sha256": "c215f7e300f83f2ef17f0fe9112409c49b5d4da39633f011c47f384a5481b544"
    },
    {
      "path": "theories/shengsheng-buxi-generative-existence/unified-2026-10-05/GENERATIVE-GROUNDING.md",
      "paragraph": "**Actual regeneration → proposed ethical contribution, 7 October 2026:** [The integrated direct continuation](../../../_process/research/2026-10-05-generative-foundation-review/root-foundation/REGENERATIVE-DIRECTION-INTEGRATION.md) establishes source-consuming regeneration of a material formation condition in the actual port, with all inquiry, recovery and initial-formation costs. It requires no aging-token correspondence; that separate mapping remains relevant only for transferring a specified channel theorem. A checked actual formation distinguishes present organization from complete-law reachability. The affirmative argument develops Ren’s criterion through genuinely usable but unexercised capacity, facing an enacted-formation rival and retaining terminal achievements and whole losses. The supplied operational laws and the ethical identification remain distinct. The next central inference is the favorable character and practical significance of that actual productive relation, not another generic renewal mechanism. Universal warrant is not yet established.",
      "paragraph_sha256": "7cad2848e3795ac7a2a643a2cae8f5c2886eadcb02615f72f111e0b52f3e6a18"
    }
  ],
